  "description": "Overview Calling all innovators, developers, and problem-solvers! Are you ready to turn your ideas into reality? The IEEE Entrepreneurship Group of Galgotias University proudly presents Hack'em Hex, an action-packed 8-hour hackathon designed to test your limits and push your technical boundaries under pressure. Whether you want to build a groundbreaking application or prototype a wild idea, this is your arena to shine. Eligibility & Team Size Open to all tech enthusiasts and students. Team Size: 1 to 4 members. Skills Required Full Stack Development UI/UX Design Problem Solving App Development Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Important Dates & Timelines Date: 18th September Duration: 8 Hours of non-stop coding & creation Venue Knowledge Centre, AIDS Block, Galgotias University (Offline Event) Entry Fee Free (₹0) Prizes & Perks Cash Prizes for the winning teams! Certificates of participation for all attendees. Exciting networking opportunities with fellow developers. Important Links Official WhatsApp Community Group: https://chat.whatsapp.com/JaEAUFKU0OMAVRnUTT7e0u",
