    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Calling all innovators, developers, and problem-solvers! Are you ready to turn your ideas into reality? The IEEE Entrepreneurship Group of Galgotias University proudly presents Hack'em Hex, an action-packed 8-hour hackathon designed to test your limits and push your technical boundaries under pressure. Whether you want to build a groundbreaking application or prototype a wild idea, this is your arena to shine.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility &amp; Team Size</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all tech enthusiasts and students.</li>\n<li>Team Size: 1 to 4 members.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Skills Required</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full Stack Development</li>\n<li>UI/UX Design</li>\n<li>Problem Solving</li>\n<li>App Development</li>\n<li>Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates &amp; Timelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 18th September</li>\n<li>Duration: 8 Hours of non-stop coding &amp; creation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Venue</strong></p>\n<p>Knowledge Centre, AIDS Block, Galgotias University (Offline Event)</p>\n<p><strong>Entry Fee</strong></p>\n<p>Free (₹0)</p>\n<p><strong>Prizes &amp; Perks</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cash Prizes for the winning teams!</li>\n<li>Certificates of participation for all attendees.</li>\n<li>Exciting networking opportunities with fellow developers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Links</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official WhatsApp Community Group: <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/JaEAUFKU0OMAVRnUTT7e0u\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/JaEAUFKU0OMAVRnUTT7e0u</a></li>\n</ul>",
